-- ============================================================
-- Physical rather than shadow, and SpellFamilyName 0 rather than the donor's
-- 15.  Clearing the family is deliberate: a cloned custom spell inherits the
-- donor's talent support otherwise, and a warrior-family payload would pick up
-- every SPELLMOD written for warrior damage -- the Barricade mistake
-- (TODO.md:484).  The damage is already scaled off block value; nothing else
-- should touch it.
--
-- Family 0 also means this spell cannot match Incite's own spell_proc filter
-- (family 4, mask 4194496), so the proc cannot feed itself.
--
-- Cloned from 200126 (Mark of Blood's damage helper, 2026_03_31_05.sql), which
-- exists for the same reason: a helper spell is what makes the hit show up in
-- the combat log instead of appearing as unattributed damage.
DELETE FROM `alonecraft_spell_dbc` WHERE `ID` = 200660;
